      "spam": false,
      "value": "That avatar is mild in the flashing colors department. I rather see a different solution like a graphics option or seizure blacklist of sorts.\n\nA very small percentage of people may experience a seizure when exposed to certain visual images, including flashing lights or patterns that may appear in video games. Even people who have no history of seizures or epilepsy may have an undiagnosed condition that can cause these “photosensitive epileptic seizures” while watching video games.",
